
[TestPreferSuperOverThis/invalid-0 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: preferSuper (1:61 - 1:64)
Message: `run` comes from a base class — reach it through `super`, not `this`.
Help: Write `super.run` so the reader can see the member is inherited.
   1 | class A { run(): void {} } class B extends A { go(): void { this.run(); } }
     |                                                             ~~~~
